; EduAmigaE-Game generated build boot
;
; Expected volumes:
;   SYSTEM:  student supplied AmigaOS system
;   SRC:     staged E source
;   OUT:     build output
;   RUNTIME: course Amiga-side scripts
;   EVO:     E-VO distribution

FailAt 20

Assign C: SYSTEM:C
Assign L: SYSTEM:L
Assign LIBS: SYSTEM:LIBS
Assign DEVS: SYSTEM:DEVS
Assign S: SYSTEM:S
Path C: ADD

Assign EDUSRC: SRC:
Assign EDUOUT: OUT:
Assign EDURUNTIME: RUNTIME:
Assign E: EVO:

Echo "EduAmigaE-Game unattended build"
Execute EDURUNTIME:build.evo "hello.e"

If WARN
  Echo "FAIL" > EDUOUT:BUILD.FAIL
Else
  Echo "PASS" > EDUOUT:BUILD.PASS
EndIf

EndCLI >NIL:
